# What the build does not need.
#
# The build command is `npm run verify`, which typechecks, runs the unit tests,
# builds apps/web and checks the bundle budget. Everything below is outside
# that path: the C console build, the Playwright suites and their artefacts,
# the dormant workflows, and the documents. Keeping them out of the upload
# keeps a deploy about the thing being deployed.
#
# The end to end suites are deliberately excluded. They are a gate that runs
# before a deploy, on a machine with a browser, not during one.

cli
e2e
playwright.config.ts
playwright.smoke.config.ts
playwright-report
test-results

.github
*.md

.lighthouseci
coverage
